  "description": "Climb the branches of knowledge in Nature’s Question, an engaging quiz that turns curiosity about the natural world into a journey of growth and challenge. Guided by Sylvaran, the forest’s guardian spirit, you must answer questions to restore the strength of the Ancient Tree and reach the top of its majestic living tower.\n\nEach correct answer strengthens the tree and lets you advance through its floors, while mistakes end the journey and invite you to try again. As you climb higher, questions become more challenging and time becomes more precious, demanding focus, quick thinking, and strategic decisions.\n\nUse your points to activate powerful aids at the right moment, overcoming obstacles and keeping your ascent alive. With shuffled questions in every run and dynamic progression, each playthrough offers a new opportunity to prove your knowledge.\n\nRelax in nature-inspired environments, challenge your mind, and discover how far your knowledge can take you. In Nature’s Question, every answer brings you one step closer to the top of the Ancient Tree.",
